 "description": "One member of the US Congress, by bioguide ID or name: profile (party, chamber, state, district, in office or former, terms served with start and end dates), trade statistics since 2020 (trades, buys, sells, estimated volume in USD, median filing delay in days, late trades and the reports that contain them, number of reports and how many are paper or scanned, latest filing date) and the 5 tickers the member traded most, with livermore.club links. Use get_congress_trades with the bioguide ID for the trades. Data: House and Senate periodic transaction reports (PTRs) filed since 2020-01-01, from the U.S. House Clerk and the Senate Office of Public Records (eFD), updated daily. Amounts are the statutory ranges members report, not exact values: amount_min_usd to amount_max_usd, where a null amount_max_usd is an 'Over $X' range; estimated volumes add up range midpoints (an 'Over $X' range counts as X), so treat them as rough sizes. Trades replaced by an amendment and duplicates reported again in a later filing are left out. Paper and scanned reports are listed on member pages but their trades are not read.",
